# SCENARIO: baseline_b3_proximity   SEED: 0   CAMERAS: none   BOTCFG: auto
# Phase 3 (lean) baseline B3 — player-proximity weighting. NORMAL AI. The player parks next to the
# Thais temple for 15 min (plan said 30; cut for the time box). Server truth: journal [PROXBIAS]
# per-selection + 60 s summary + hib_by_town histogram; audit census (town awake/hib) + decide
# (`watch *` = low-rate kinds). Client truth: unique bots seen. Metrics: baseline_metrics.py b3.
@srv audit kinds wake,hib,state,decide,census,cmd
@srv audit watch *
@srv audit on expect="enabled=on"
@srv audit mark "B3 start"
@p1 login
@p1 goto 32369,32228,7 range=2 stuck=15 timeout=120
@p1 hold 900
@srv expect src=srv msg~="PROXBIAS" min=1 within=1000
@srv expect src=srv:audit k=census min=60 within=1000
@srv audit mark "B3 end"
@srv audit watch clear
@srv audit off
@p1 logout
